<title>ITALY: Italy's total reserves 107.334 trln lire in April.</title>
<headline>Italy's total reserves 107.334 trln lire in April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 107.334 trillion lire at end-April, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				    April 97     March 97     April 96</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    107.334	108.643	97.919</p>
<p>    Total assets		109.129	110.579     102.118</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	37.491	 37.491	39.542</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.795	  1.936	 4.199</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)     154	    0.307	 2.607</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
